      "editorial_warning": "Physical page45 contains the printed chain [zi,j]=-[zi]=-w1=wa. Earlier definitions set v1=-w1 and Proposition7.5 states [zi,j]=-[zi]; the same paragraph explicitly sets wa=-w1 as the inner normal. Preserve the original sign-chain text and its separately explicit slope and inner-normal definitions; no editorial replacement is made.",
